(5189972, 755526, 95940, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the lighting and the Skin Tone. would have given a 9 or ten but the Binder was was cropped off. Good work. I like it. It meets the challenge better than mine!</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the lighting and the Skin Tone. would have given a 9 or ten but the Binder was was cropped off. Good work. I like it. It meets the challenge better than mine!', '2009-01-14 00:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189996, 755921, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is really good.  good use of shallow dof.</td>', 'this is really good.  good use of shallow dof.', '2009-01-14 00:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189999, 754614, 28882, '<td valign="top">haha, that''s great.  nice shot.</td>', 'haha, that''s great.  nice shot.', '2009-01-14 00:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190001, 755084, 28882, '<td valign="top">really nice shot.  i like this muted color look.</td>', 'really nice shot.  i like this muted color look.', '2009-01-14 00:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190024, 755840, 29269, '<td valign="top">A little bit too dark / artsy for a stock photo. I would expect something that is more of a in-your-face, bright, aggressive for the business person stock photo. <br/>But otherwise, I like the image very much.</td>', 'A little bit too dark / artsy for a stock photo. I would expect something that is more of a in-your-face, bright, aggressive for the business person stock photo. But otherwise, I like the image very much.', '2009-01-14 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190027, 755624, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, perfect stock photo theme, but execution lacks. Image seems too small (not a problem affecting the score, I just wish I could see better), but then this strong backlight does not help either... an average shot in the end.</td>', 'Nice idea, perfect stock photo theme, but execution lacks. Image seems too small (not a problem affecting the score, I just wish I could see better), but then this strong backlight does not help either... an average shot in the end.', '2009-01-14 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190031, 753995, 29269, '<td valign="top">This is really stocky (a real word?). I''m not sure about the unbuttoned shirt (I''m far from prude, but I don''t get the intended use for this image with[out] the button).</td>', 'This is really stocky (a real word?). I''m not sure about the unbuttoned shirt (I''m far from prude, but I don''t get the intended use for this image with[out] the button).', '2009-01-14 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190035, 755578, 29269, '<td valign="top">Not amusing, not artsy, nor fancy... a perfect stock photo applicable to any number of ads. The best one so far for the challenge. 10!</td>', 'Not amusing, not artsy, nor fancy... a perfect stock photo applicable to any number of ads. The best one so far for the challenge. 10!', '2009-01-14 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190038, 755075, 29269, '<td valign="top">This could have been stronger if she was doing anything remotely resembling some kind of business-related activity - checking her PDA, talking on the phone etc. This is charm-based, and it has limited attraction power... I also hate that flare above her head...</td>', 'This could have been stronger if she was doing anything remotely resembling some kind of business-related activity - checking her PDA, talking on the phone etc. This is charm-based, and it has limited attraction power... I also hate that flare above her head...', '2009-01-14 01:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190042, 755972, 29269, '<td valign="top">A good idea to put someone in front of the ubiquitous projector in a meeting room... however I think that you would have gotten a stronger image with less details. Meaning: wider angle shot, capturing more of a business person with more of the environment. I did not need to see the specifics of the presentation, nor it serves any purpose as a generic stock photo to show a server farm topology or whatever that is...</td>', 'A good idea to put someone in front of the ubiquitous projector in a meeting room... however I think that you would have gotten a stronger image with less details. Meaning: wider angle shot, capturing more of a business person with more of the environment. I did not need to see the specifics of the presentation, nor it serves any purpose as a generic stock photo to show a server farm topology or whatever that is...', '2009-01-14 01:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190046, 753945, 55956, '<td valign="top">mmm are you sure that this photo has been captured during this week? it seems me strange that in the Louvre is possible in this period of the year go whit that T-shirt.</td>', 'mmm are you sure that this photo has been captured during this week? it seems me strange that in the Louvre is possible in this period of the year go whit that T-shirt.', '2009-01-14 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190048, 755526, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hmm, stock photo - yes, definitively. Model is deserving of a 11 herself. Everything is there, plain white background allowing for text overlay, professional. I would only comment on the choice of having scantily clad young lady here: it will definitively get you DPC votes. However, I''ve seen a select few (maybe only 2) entries here that would sell more as stock photo, just because of the limited usability of such image in ad world. Because of that, I''ll take away 2 points from 11 she deserves: 9.</td>', 'Hmm, stock photo - yes, definitively. Model is deserving of a 11 herself. Everything is there, plain white background allowing for text overlay, professional. I would only comment on the choice of having scantily clad young lady here: it will definitively get you DPC votes. However, I''ve seen a select few (maybe only 2) entries here that would sell more as stock photo, just because of the limited usability of such image in ad world. Because of that, I''ll take away 2 points from 11 she deserves: 9.', '2009-01-14 01:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190050, 754314, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''m going to try to think about this one some more... I''ll pass on scoring it until I figure out what it is. The benefit is that there are only 37 entries, so I can afford to spend more time on all of the images.</td>', 'I''m going to try to think about this one some more... I''ll pass on scoring it until I figure out what it is. The benefit is that there are only 37 entries, so I can afford to spend more time on all of the images.', '2009-01-14 01:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190082, 755526, 11467, '<td valign="top">Good stock photo, but I wouldn''t have cropped the folder on the right. (Bet I''m not the only one to say that ;) )</td>', 'Good stock photo, but I wouldn''t have cropped the folder on the right. (Bet I''m not the only one to say that ;) )', '2009-01-14 02:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
