(5190779, 754314, 84907, '<td valign="top">Well, you were right, I don''t understand.</td>', 'Well, you were right, I don''t understand.', '2009-01-14 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190783, 753945, 84907, '<td valign="top">While I am sure you will get some debate on if this meets the challenge, I would rather focus on the technicals.  For me, the framing and composition could have been improved to make this a much more appealing shot.  The mini fence on the right immediately takes my eye away from the rest of the scene.  Additionally, the light post moving through pyramid hampers the image in my eyes.  I very much like the off-center approach to the composition as straight on would have left the image rather flat and dull for me.</td>', 'While I am sure you will get some debate on if this meets the challenge, I would rather focus on the technicals.  For me, the framing and composition could have been improved to make this a much more appealing shot.  The mini fence on the right immediately takes my eye away from the rest of the scene.  Additionally, the light post moving through pyramid hampers the image in my eyes.  I very much like the off-center approach to the composition as straight on would have left the image rather flat and dull for me.', '2009-01-14 11:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190788, 755948, 84907, '<td valign="top">A fun idea.  I wish that your lighting would have made it back to the business person.  Specifically the hair starts to get lost in the darker background.  I would also think about doubling over tape and putting in under the post it notes as putting it on top of the post it means you get some reflective glare that immediately draws the eye.</td>', 'A fun idea.  I wish that your lighting would have made it back to the business person.  Specifically the hair starts to get lost in the darker background.  I would also think about doubling over tape and putting in under the post it notes as putting it on top of the post it means you get some reflective glare that immediately draws the eye.', '2009-01-14 11:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190791, 755972, 84907, '<td valign="top">A very nice take on the challenge and well accomplished visually.  I am sure the lighting was not a fun thing to balance on this shot, and I think you did it very well.</td>', 'A very nice take on the challenge and well accomplished visually.  I am sure the lighting was not a fun thing to balance on this shot, and I think you did it very well.', '2009-01-14 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190793, 754587, 84907, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this shot.</td>', 'Great lighting on this shot.', '2009-01-14 11:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190795, 753995, 84907, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait.  The use of this picture as a stock photo though would leave me scratching my head.  A few buttons too many unbuttoned for that purpose.</td>', 'A very nice portrait.  The use of this picture as a stock photo though would leave me scratching my head.  A few buttons too many unbuttoned for that purpose.', '2009-01-14 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190798, 755075, 84907, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background helps this picture, and the lens flare does not appeal to my eye either.  If this is a candid I can understand the background, but if this is a posed shot keep an eye on what might detract the viewers eye from your main subject.</td>', 'I don''t think the background helps this picture, and the lens flare does not appeal to my eye either.  If this is a candid I can understand the background, but if this is a posed shot keep an eye on what might detract the viewers eye from your main subject.', '2009-01-14 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190805, 755908, 84907, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge.  Great angle and model placement.  The only area I can see that grabs my eye for improvement is taking the model either into the middle or further away from the white wall above and behind her.  I would either place her in the middle or with empty space between her and the wall, but currently she is barely covering over into it which gives it a bit of a weird feel for me.  Still a great shot and one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge.  Great angle and model placement.  The only area I can see that grabs my eye for improvement is taking the model either into the middle or further away from the white wall above and behind her.  I would either place her in the middle or with empty space between her and the wall, but currently she is barely covering over into it which gives it a bit of a weird feel for me.  Still a great shot and one of my favorites so far.', '2009-01-14 11:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190812, 755840, 84907, '<td valign="top">Very nice solid image.  A nice use of lighting to highlight and give a very professional look to your image.  Framing is great very solid.</td>', 'Very nice solid image.  A nice use of lighting to highlight and give a very professional look to your image.  Framing is great very solid.', '2009-01-14 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
