(5191791, 755981, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, thematically on target, suggestive, and VERY stock.  well done<br/>Only thing I might alter is his dress.  It''s a little too casual, IMO.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, thematically on target, suggestive, and VERY stock.  well doneOnly thing I might alter is his dress.  It''s a little too casual, IMO.', '2009-01-14 20:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191792, 755526, 94876, '<td valign="top">This looks like a stock photo.  Nuff said.  8</td>', 'This looks like a stock photo.  Nuff said.  8', '2009-01-14 20:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191798, 753995, 94876, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I personally feel that the combination of the undone buttons, the pen in the mouth and the confused, slightly neurotic look in the eyes of the model suggest something "other" than business.  Or maybe another type of business, but compositionally, all the elements are there.</td>', 'Not bad.  I personally feel that the combination of the undone buttons, the pen in the mouth and the confused, slightly neurotic look in the eyes of the model suggest something "other" than business.  Or maybe another type of business, but compositionally, all the elements are there.', '2009-01-14 21:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191811, 755517, 94876, '<td valign="top">Is it me, or does Elmo actually look like he''s looking at the Mac?   I can''t actually see anything wrong here. Like the POV, too.</td>', 'Is it me, or does Elmo actually look like he''s looking at the Mac?   I can''t actually see anything wrong here. Like the POV, too.', '2009-01-14 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191825, 755624, 49930, '<td valign="top">A really intersting approach -well thought out, great concept.</td>', 'A really intersting approach -well thought out, great concept.', '2009-01-14 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191827, 754614, 49930, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate for the times. Well done.</td>', 'Very appropriate for the times. Well done.', '2009-01-14 21:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191828, 755075, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like this setup.  The lens flare is a bit much for me, personally. And the look on the models face, as well as general body language suggest something to me other than the business world.  I get the impression she has things on her mind.  She doesn''t look happy at all to me.  Maybe posing her on a cell, or with a newspaper, or something might have changed her mood a bit.  But it''s a thoughtful image, IMO.</td>', 'I like this setup.  The lens flare is a bit much for me, personally. And the look on the models face, as well as general body language suggest something to me other than the business world.  I get the impression she has things on her mind.  She doesn''t look happy at all to me.  Maybe posing her on a cell, or with a newspaper, or something might have changed her mood a bit.  But it''s a thoughtful image, IMO.', '2009-01-14 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191832, 755036, 49930, '<td valign="top">Love the concept. I like the tones (although his skin comes up a little red on my monitor). Well done</td>', 'Love the concept. I like the tones (although his skin comes up a little red on my monitor). Well done', '2009-01-14 21:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191833, 754917, 94876, '<td valign="top">Snow is tough enough to balance to begin with.  Add shadows into the mix, and it becomes even more so.<br/>I''m not sure this meets the theme, IMO.</td>', 'Snow is tough enough to balance to begin with.  Add shadows into the mix, and it becomes even more so.I''m not sure this meets the theme, IMO.', '2009-01-14 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191834, 755908, 49930, '<td valign="top">Like the effect of the background. Makes for an interesting protrait.</td>', 'Like the effect of the background. Makes for an interesting protrait.', '2009-01-14 21:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191835, 755196, 49930, '<td valign="top">Quite a giggle. Overworked and under paid - a real super hero.</td>', 'Quite a giggle. Overworked and under paid - a real super hero.', '2009-01-14 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191837, 754587, 49930, '<td valign="top">Well exposed. I like the tones and lighting in this. Good concept.</td>', 'Well exposed. I like the tones and lighting in this. Good concept.', '2009-01-14 21:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191841, 755569, 49930, '<td valign="top">This gave me a laugh. Well done.</td>', 'This gave me a laugh. Well done.', '2009-01-14 21:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191842, 755606, 49930, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I like the movement here - you have captured it well.</td>', 'Good concept. I like the movement here - you have captured it well.', '2009-01-14 21:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
