(5191893, 755847, 94876, '<td valign="top">There are several distracting elements at work here.  Firstly, that plant, the paperwork, and the printer in the background.  Changing the POV may have helped this.  Secondly, the frontal lighting is harsh, and creates some nasty highlights.  I also feel that the model isn''t helping the composition any.</td>', 'There are several distracting elements at work here.  Firstly, that plant, the paperwork, and the printer in the background.  Changing the POV may have helped this.  Secondly, the frontal lighting is harsh, and creates some nasty highlights.  I also feel that the model isn''t helping the composition any.', '2009-01-14 21:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191895, 755624, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  It IS stock, IMO.  The thing I''m not keen on is the upward lighting.  It creates some blown out highlights and some distracting shadows.</td>', 'I like the idea.  It IS stock, IMO.  The thing I''m not keen on is the upward lighting.  It creates some blown out highlights and some distracting shadows.', '2009-01-14 21:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191899, 755990, 94876, '<td valign="top">I understand the selective desat.  In fact, I wouldn''t have noticed the Visa/MC sign without it.  But the comp itself is rather unbalanced.  It seems slightly out of focus, and even though the eye is drawn to the Visa/MC sign, I am still not sure where the focal point of the image lies.  This is all convention, and I''m sure many people will adore this image more than I do as a matter of taste.  I hope this helps.</td>', 'I understand the selective desat.  In fact, I wouldn''t have noticed the Visa/MC sign without it.  But the comp itself is rather unbalanced.  It seems slightly out of focus, and even though the eye is drawn to the Visa/MC sign, I am still not sure where the focal point of the image lies.  This is all convention, and I''m sure many people will adore this image more than I do as a matter of taste.  I hope this helps.', '2009-01-14 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191914, 755944, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Good lighting.  Excellent use of a concrete saw.  Something I notice in your model that has been missing in some other entrants'' models is that his expression matches the title.  He looks like a guy that wants my business and wants to take it to the next level.  Great effort.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Good lighting.  Excellent use of a concrete saw.  Something I notice in your model that has been missing in some other entrants'' models is that his expression matches the title.  He looks like a guy that wants my business and wants to take it to the next level.  Great effort.', '2009-01-14 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191922, 753945, 94876, '<td valign="top">I feel like this may be a stretch, thematically.  That said, compositionally, I like the balance of the frame, the sense of movement.  It''s an interesting capture, it just doesn''t line up thematically, for me personally.</td>', 'I feel like this may be a stretch, thematically.  That said, compositionally, I like the balance of the frame, the sense of movement.  It''s an interesting capture, it just doesn''t line up thematically, for me personally.', '2009-01-14 22:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191926, 755569, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like this capture alot.  It speaks volumes.  The only thing I notice is the highlights in the top right corner on the wall.  It almost looks like you used a wall sconce to light the scene.  But overall, a nice effort, IMO.</td>', 'I like this capture alot.  It speaks volumes.  The only thing I notice is the highlights in the top right corner on the wall.  It almost looks like you used a wall sconce to light the scene.  But overall, a nice effort, IMO.', '2009-01-14 22:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191930, 754587, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I like the model''s expression and the sense of urgency created by his looking at the watch.  The dramatic lighting is nice,  The only thing I might have done differently is cropping out the lamp.  It detracts a touch, IMO.  But overall, a really well executed idea.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I like the model''s expression and the sense of urgency created by his looking at the watch.  The dramatic lighting is nice,  The only thing I might have done differently is cropping out the lamp.  It detracts a touch, IMO.  But overall, a really well executed idea.', '2009-01-14 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191931, 755084, 69668, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the entire bunch.  A 10 from me!!</td>', 'My favorite of the entire bunch.  A 10 from me!!', '2009-01-14 22:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191932, 755974, 94876, '<td valign="top">Great concept and execution.  Very clever, indeed.  Not much to say here ''cept I like it.  Well done!</td>', 'Great concept and execution.  Very clever, indeed.  Not much to say here ''cept I like it.  Well done!', '2009-01-14 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191936, 755948, 94876, '<td valign="top">Great idea, IMO.  I''m not sure the execution is quite where it could be.  I''m seeing halos around the book.  I wonder if that''s a PP choice, or a slow shutter.  The image should have been exposed for the face, and not the book, because the post-its are the star of this image, not the book, IMO.  Also, you can see the tape on the post-its and it detracts a little bit.  The image is underexposed overall, as well.  But like I said, a pretty humorous concept, in general.</td>', 'Great idea, IMO.  I''m not sure the execution is quite where it could be.  I''m seeing halos around the book.  I wonder if that''s a PP choice, or a slow shutter.  The image should have been exposed for the face, and not the book, because the post-its are the star of this image, not the book, IMO.  Also, you can see the tape on the post-its and it detracts a little bit.  The image is underexposed overall, as well.  But like I said, a pretty humorous concept, in general.', '2009-01-14 22:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191940, 755084, 94876, '<td valign="top">We have some great tonal qualities here.  It''s an effective image.  It''s suggestive, and technically sound.  I could definitely see stock photo here.  Love the high contrast, as well.  Well executed! 9</td>', 'We have some great tonal qualities here.  It''s an effective image.  It''s suggestive, and technically sound.  I could definitely see stock photo here.  Love the high contrast, as well.  Well executed! 9', '2009-01-14 22:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
