(5193503, 755606, 96614, '<td valign="top">Very creative!!! Really good job on the motion in the paper!  First off, I would say that the backdrop should be white, BUT then you wouldn''t see the paper as nicely, so i agree with your choice, NICE! (8)</td>', 'Very creative!!! Really good job on the motion in the paper!  First off, I would say that the backdrop should be white, BUT then you wouldn''t see the paper as nicely, so i agree with your choice, NICE! (8)', '2009-01-15 20:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
