(5193517, 755921, 96614, '<td valign="top">I really like this one!  the only thing I might do is lighten up the hand holding the marker... is it too much in shadow... BUT i''m still giving you a perfect 10  =)</td>', 'I really like this one!  the only thing I might do is lighten up the hand holding the marker... is it too much in shadow... BUT i''m still giving you a perfect 10  =)', '2009-01-15 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
