(5193725, 755084, 102505, '<td valign="top">Once I was able to see it for the advertising potential I really started to like the shot. I like how the bokeh of the trees becomes the art on the left side of the board. Might be a blackberry ad. Good Shot!</td>', 'Once I was able to see it for the advertising potential I really started to like the shot. I like how the bokeh of the trees becomes the art on the left side of the board. Might be a blackberry ad. Good Shot!', '2009-01-15 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
