(5197095, 755136, 98171, '<td valign="top">This photo received my highest rating in the challenge. Your use of lighting creates a nice mood. Great image.</td>', 'This photo received my highest rating in the challenge. Your use of lighting creates a nice mood. Great image.', '2009-01-16 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197183, 755847, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems negatively affected by an on camera flash. The plant is harshly lit, with severe dropoff by the time it gets to the woman. One trick you can use if you don''t have an external flash that can be rotated and bounced, is to tape an index card in front of your cameras pop-up flash in order to bounce the flash off the ceiling.</td>', 'Seems negatively affected by an on camera flash. The plant is harshly lit, with severe dropoff by the time it gets to the woman. One trick you can use if you don''t have an external flash that can be rotated and bounced, is to tape an index card in front of your cameras pop-up flash in order to bounce the flash off the ceiling.', '2009-01-16 20:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197214, 755921, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bob''s coworkers all wondered why he spent so much time alone in the conference room. It shocked all of them to learn he was addicted to marker ink fumes. Bob is now in rehabilitation and is doing well, but is only allowed to do his business presentations with crayons.<br/> <br/>Nicely done. My only minor quibble is that his face is just in focus enough to draw my eye to him, instead of the chart in the foreground.</td>', 'Bob''s coworkers all wondered why he spent so much time alone in the conference room. It shocked all of them to learn he was addicted to marker ink fumes. Bob is now in rehabilitation and is doing well, but is only allowed to do his business presentations with crayons. Nicely done. My only minor quibble is that his face is just in focus enough to draw my eye to him, instead of the chart in the foreground.', '2009-01-16 20:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197251, 755517, 83313, '<td valign="top">What other positions can we fill? <br/>Payroll: The Count<br/>Sales: Oscar the Grouch<br/>Technical support: Big bird<br/>Legal dept: Super-Grover<br/>Marketing: Ernie &amp; Bert<br/>Product development: Snuffleuphagus</td>', 'What other positions can we fill? Payroll: The CountSales: Oscar the GrouchTechnical support: Big birdLegal dept: Super-GroverMarketing: Ernie & BertProduct development: Snuffleuphagus', '2009-01-16 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
