(5199582, 755566, 83313, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with frilly panties. How about offering them as tradeshow swag, with your company logo printed on the cheek?<br/> <br/>Not sure if this could really be used as stock, but it looks the part. Well, maybe for the right kind of article.</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with frilly panties. How about offering them as tradeshow swag, with your company logo printed on the cheek? Not sure if this could really be used as stock, but it looks the part. Well, maybe for the right kind of article.', '2009-01-17 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199587, 754587, 83313, '<td valign="top">Work? Probably just checking DPC scores after midnight rollover.</td>', 'Work? Probably just checking DPC scores after midnight rollover.', '2009-01-17 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199597, 755959, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess that''s a contract he''s holding up? I might like it better cropped a little closer to the subject, but that''s more an opinion thing on composition than any actual flaw.</td>', 'I guess that''s a contract he''s holding up? I might like it better cropped a little closer to the subject, but that''s more an opinion thing on composition than any actual flaw.', '2009-01-17 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199602, 755456, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fun tie and the idea certainly fits as a stock shot. Composition seems a little odd. Not sure what to suggest.</td>', 'Fun tie and the idea certainly fits as a stock shot. Composition seems a little odd. Not sure what to suggest.', '2009-01-17 15:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199610, 755486, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a traditional "business person" shot, but I can see your idea. Not every business person wears a suit. Not sure if this would sell as a stock shot for the subject though.</td>', 'Not a traditional "business person" shot, but I can see your idea. Not every business person wears a suit. Not sure if this would sell as a stock shot for the subject though.', '2009-01-17 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199666, 756000, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think your explanation in the title was needed. Without it, I may not have realized where it could be used. Composition seems a little centered and the photo overall is a bit flat, but with a lot of potential. Out of curiosity, I popped this into my image editor and some basic adjustments (levels, curves, saturation &amp; contrast) really gave this a lot of the visual pop that I would expect this to have if it were printed in an advertisement of magazine.</td>', 'I think your explanation in the title was needed. Without it, I may not have realized where it could be used. Composition seems a little centered and the photo overall is a bit flat, but with a lot of potential. Out of curiosity, I popped this into my image editor and some basic adjustments (levels, curves, saturation & contrast) really gave this a lot of the visual pop that I would expect this to have if it were printed in an advertisement of magazine.', '2009-01-17 15:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199684, 755974, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and well done for the most part. One big problem for me, however. The add-on to the watch looks homemade. If you had done it on a printer and cut out the circle a little smoother, I think it would have looked slicker and worked much better for this scene.</td>', 'Great idea, and well done for the most part. One big problem for me, however. The add-on to the watch looks homemade. If you had done it on a printer and cut out the circle a little smoother, I think it would have looked slicker and worked much better for this scene.', '2009-01-17 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199691, 755990, 83313, '<td valign="top">Accepted everywhere, right? The spot of bright logo in the middle of a sepia shot doesn''t usually work for me. It doesn''t here either, I''m afraid, but I do recognize how you needed to draw attention to those logos.</td>', 'Accepted everywhere, right? The spot of bright logo in the middle of a sepia shot doesn''t usually work for me. It doesn''t here either, I''m afraid, but I do recognize how you needed to draw attention to those logos.', '2009-01-17 15:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199719, 755840, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this for the most part. Your lighting, background and subject are perfect for the challenge and for stock shots in general. It comes off to me as a touch darker and duller than I would expect though. I popped this into my editor to see, and some quick levels, curves and contrast really made this pop nicely and looks like something I would see in an advertisement.</td>', 'I like this for the most part. Your lighting, background and subject are perfect for the challenge and for stock shots in general. It comes off to me as a touch darker and duller than I would expect though. I popped this into my editor to see, and some quick levels, curves and contrast really made this pop nicely and looks like something I would see in an advertisement.', '2009-01-17 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
