(5201918, 755084, 62187, '<td valign="top">A pretty good take - I don''t think it''s exactly what they''re looking for (like my entry is - NOT!) but I still think it will do very good. It''s the best shoehorn, a 10 to me and I''m hoping will be in the top 3 photos.</td>', 'A pretty good take - I don''t think it''s exactly what they''re looking for (like my entry is - NOT!) but I still think it will do very good. It''s the best shoehorn, a 10 to me and I''m hoping will be in the top 3 photos.', '2009-01-18 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201919, 755084, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is my only 10 in this challenge. I love the environment, the unusuality of the story you tell here. I love the way you desaturated colours, though, the smile and the business wear with the snowboard tell the story of a real colourful manager life! You did a great job! I would immediately apply for any job advertised with this photo! (10)</td>', 'This is my only 10 in this challenge. I love the environment, the unusuality of the story you tell here. I love the way you desaturated colours, though, the smile and the business wear with the snowboard tell the story of a real colourful manager life! You did a great job! I would immediately apply for any job advertised with this photo! (10)', '2009-01-18 13:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201920, 755921, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very good, probably exactly what they''re looking for: 9</td>', 'Very good, probably exactly what they''re looking for: 9', '2009-01-18 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201921, 755036, 62187, '<td valign="top">Probably exactly what the challenge called for. I just think it''s slightly over sharpened: 9</td>', 'Probably exactly what the challenge called for. I just think it''s slightly over sharpened: 9', '2009-01-18 13:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201922, 755578, 62187, '<td valign="top">Probably exactly what the challenge wanted. I think it could be slightly sharper: 9</td>', 'Probably exactly what the challenge wanted. I think it could be slightly sharper: 9', '2009-01-18 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201923, 754314, 10858, '<td valign="top">The photo is not bad, though, the challenge was about capturing a business person. I miss the person on this photo, sorry. (3)</td>', 'The photo is not bad, though, the challenge was about capturing a business person. I miss the person on this photo, sorry. (3)', '2009-01-18 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201924, 754314, 62187, '<td valign="top">...but I do understand: 9 ''cause it''s a total shoehorn with a great emotive feel. So what it''s not a ''person''!</td>', '...but I do understand: 9 ''cause it''s a total shoehorn with a great emotive feel. So what it''s not a ''person''!', '2009-01-18 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
