(5207437, 755543, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is a good one. I like the suggestive look of your model, capturing eye contact. It is very important for an advertisement photo, to make interaction with the one looking. The alltogether atmosphere of the photo earns trust. One of my favs in this challenge. (9)</td>', 'This is a good one. I like the suggestive look of your model, capturing eye contact. It is very important for an advertisement photo, to make interaction with the one looking. The alltogether atmosphere of the photo earns trust. One of my favs in this challenge. (9)', '2009-01-20 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207444, 755606, 10858, '<td valign="top">I could imagine this as an advertisement for headache-pills or an antistress training. The motion is very well captured, I also like the red blouse, which breaks the greyish-black environment of this burn-out office-life. Motion and emotiveness make this photo live. The only thing I cannot really take is the border. I think the photo would work better without it. (8)</td>', 'I could imagine this as an advertisement for headache-pills or an antistress training. The motion is very well captured, I also like the red blouse, which breaks the greyish-black environment of this burn-out office-life. Motion and emotiveness make this photo live. The only thing I cannot really take is the border. I think the photo would work better without it. (8)', '2009-01-20 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207453, 754587, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is like looking into a mirror for me! :-D Just joking. The photo is simple, though, very talkative. I like the way you use the foreground and depth of fields, also the expression of your model. Good luck! (8)</td>', 'This is like looking into a mirror for me! :-D Just joking. The photo is simple, though, very talkative. I like the way you use the foreground and depth of fields, also the expression of your model. Good luck! (8)', '2009-01-20 19:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207459, 755921, 10858, '<td valign="top">I truly love the concept and the shallow depth of fields! What makes this shot funny is that he is drawing up an increasing chart, though, from my point it''s decreasing. Some tags like "change your point of view" or "it''s only a matter of viewpoint" are popping up in my mind. This surely goes into my top 5 in this challenge. :-) (8)</td>', 'I truly love the concept and the shallow depth of fields! What makes this shot funny is that he is drawing up an increasing chart, though, from my point it''s decreasing. Some tags like "change your point of view" or "it''s only a matter of viewpoint" are popping up in my mind. This surely goes into my top 5 in this challenge. :-) (8)', '2009-01-20 19:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207464, 754614, 10858, '<td valign="top">Really a great one, my pick for a ribbon! One of those stock photos in this challenge which really use the environment as an important element of the subject. Great idea meets an impressive viewpoint here. I like the fired man composed on the left, it balances the composition very well. Take (9) from me!</td>', 'Really a great one, my pick for a ribbon! One of those stock photos in this challenge which really use the environment as an important element of the subject. Great idea meets an impressive viewpoint here. I like the fired man composed on the left, it balances the composition very well. Take (9) from me!', '2009-01-20 19:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207475, 755984, 10858, '<td valign="top">What a creative idea, LOL! :-) For me, it''s too tight on the top. (6)</td>', 'What a creative idea, LOL! :-) For me, it''s too tight on the top. (6)', '2009-01-20 19:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207617, 755599, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the shirt is slightly blown out. Good luck!</td>', 'Good composition but the shirt is slightly blown out. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207619, 755921, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is really great and would do well on many stock sites. I like all the elements. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'This is really great and would do well on many stock sites. I like all the elements. Well done and good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207624, 755974, 22537, '<td valign="top">Really cool concept and [pleasing composition. The "Hand drawn" dollar sign on the watch betrays the structured crispness of the rest of the image. Good luck!</td>', 'Really cool concept and [pleasing composition. The "Hand drawn" dollar sign on the watch betrays the structured crispness of the rest of the image. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207626, 755196, 22537, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before I''m sure.  This works and is a great example of a stock image!  Light is a bit hot on his forehead though. Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve seen this before I''m sure.  This works and is a great example of a stock image!  Light is a bit hot on his forehead though. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207627, 755543, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very good concept and I like the quirky element. My only critique to maintain the contrasting elements is that his hardhat should have been clean. Otherwise, nice and good luck!</td>', 'Very good concept and I like the quirky element. My only critique to maintain the contrasting elements is that his hardhat should have been clean. Otherwise, nice and good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207629, 755981, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good concept and he is certainly attired in a way that is representative of many business. I''d pull back the yellow a bit as well. Good luck!</td>', 'Good concept and he is certainly attired in a way that is representative of many business. I''d pull back the yellow a bit as well. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207634, 755136, 22537, '<td valign="top">Cool concept and I think it works well. I''d lose the chair on the right as it serves little for the balance of the shot. The right window appears to have some banding as well. Good luck!</td>', 'Cool concept and I think it works well. I''d lose the chair on the right as it serves little for the balance of the shot. The right window appears to have some banding as well. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207638, 755486, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I guess you''ve heard from a few other it doesn''t fulfil the traditional business persona. The T-Shirt may not be well received as well. ;-)  Other than that, its great!</td>', 'Great shot but I guess you''ve heard from a few other it doesn''t fulfil the traditional business persona. The T-Shirt may not be well received as well. ;-)  Other than that, its great!', '2009-01-20 21:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207641, 755624, 22537, '<td valign="top">A time tested composition but the light is too harsh.  Good luck!</td>', 'A time tested composition but the light is too harsh.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207646, 755606, 22537, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image but maybe a bit muted for stock. Boost the contrast on her a smudge and submit to a stock site then watch the money come in. One of my favs so far! 8</td>', 'Brilliant image but maybe a bit muted for stock. Boost the contrast on her a smudge and submit to a stock site then watch the money come in. One of my favs so far! 8', '2009-01-20 21:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207650, 755075, 22537, '<td valign="top">I like her and would rather have had her isolated without the traffic in the back. Lens flare is also evident and I''d pull back the Cyan just a touch. Other technicals are good and the concept is pleasingly marketable. Good luck!</td>', 'I like her and would rather have had her isolated without the traffic in the back. Lens flare is also evident and I''d pull back the Cyan just a touch. Other technicals are good and the concept is pleasingly marketable. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207653, 754587, 22537, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a student than a business person. Good control of the lighting and certainly a creative perspective of the challenge at hand.  Good luck!</td>', 'Looks more like a student than a business person. Good control of the lighting and certainly a creative perspective of the challenge at hand.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207655, 754614, 22537, '<td valign="top">Holy crap is this funny! No.....this is damn brilliant! 9</td>', 'Holy crap is this funny! No.....this is damn brilliant! 9', '2009-01-20 21:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207669, 755972, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good concept and something I would have done as well. I''d have pumped the blue saturation a bit and may position the 4 boxes slightly more to the right of his eye closer to his ear. Good luck!</td>', 'Good concept and something I would have done as well. I''d have pumped the blue saturation a bit and may position the 4 boxes slightly more to the right of his eye closer to his ear. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207674, 754314, 22537, '<td valign="top">Deep and most advertisers might find it a bit too restrictive. Nice fence though. ;-)</td>', 'Deep and most advertisers might find it a bit too restrictive. Nice fence though. ;-)', '2009-01-20 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207676, 756000, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good concept and a bit of contrast would help the impact. Good luck!</td>', 'Good concept and a bit of contrast would help the impact. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207681, 755840, 22537, '<td valign="top">Pleasing and clean.  Boost the light on him and his shirt a bit and you''d have a great stock shot!</td>', 'Pleasing and clean.  Boost the light on him and his shirt a bit and you''d have a great stock shot!', '2009-01-20 21:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207683, 755847, 22537, '<td valign="top">I''d clean up the desk and attempt more even lighting. Good luck!</td>', 'I''d clean up the desk and attempt more even lighting. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207686, 755517, 22537, '<td valign="top">Elmo a corporate baron?? Fun shot and I''d straighten the laptop a bit to malign better with the bottom of the frame. Good luck!</td>', 'Elmo a corporate baron?? Fun shot and I''d straighten the laptop a bit to malign better with the bottom of the frame. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207687, 753995, 22537, '<td valign="top">Really well done and quirky.  This would do well on a stock site.  Good luck!</td>', 'Really well done and quirky.  This would do well on a stock site.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207691, 755569, 22537, '<td valign="top">Brown calls in top bank bosses huh? Mr. Brown''s father needs a bit more contrast though. ;-) Good luck!</td>', 'Brown calls in top bank bosses huh? Mr. Brown''s father needs a bit more contrast though. ;-) Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207698, 755084, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing image and quirky concept. This is fun and would certainly have a niche market.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very pleasing image and quirky concept. This is fun and would certainly have a niche market.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207701, 755566, 22537, '<td valign="top">And a fine case for briefs! Well done but the shadows are a bit harsh.  I do like it though!</td>', 'And a fine case for briefs! Well done but the shadows are a bit harsh.  I do like it though!', '2009-01-20 21:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207703, 755959, 22537, '<td valign="top">Well done and I''d reduce the amount of negative space as it detracts from the subject. Good luck!</td>', 'Well done and I''d reduce the amount of negative space as it detracts from the subject. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207723, 755924, 22537, '<td valign="top">I really like what you are attempting with your lighting but the contrast has cost you too much detail. A fresh perspective though and good luck!</td>', 'I really like what you are attempting with your lighting but the contrast has cost you too much detail. A fresh perspective though and good luck!', '2009-01-20 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207725, 755984, 22537, '<td valign="top">Fun and funny. Light is a bit hot on his snout though.  Good luck!</td>', 'Fun and funny. Light is a bit hot on his snout though.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207729, 755990, 22537, '<td valign="top">A social commentary that might fit well in an editorial spread.  Walking on the fringes of the challenge description though but I''ll give you a 6 for stretching our brains a bit.  Good luck!</td>', 'A social commentary that might fit well in an editorial spread.  Walking on the fringes of the challenge description though but I''ll give you a 6 for stretching our brains a bit.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207734, 755526, 22537, '<td valign="top">Clean shot and well presented. The light is a bit hot on the cuff and her left collar. This is certainly standard stock imagery.  Good luck!</td>', 'Clean shot and well presented. The light is a bit hot on the cuff and her left collar. This is certainly standard stock imagery.  Good luck!', '2009-01-20 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
