(5208124, 753995, 54645, '<td valign="top">"Not bad. I personally feel that the combination of the undone buttons, the pen in the mouth and the confused, slightly neurotic look in the eyes of the model suggest something "other" than business. Or maybe another type of business, but compositionally, all the elements are there."<br/> <br/>LOL!!!! Well done Lydia. You could have title it Librarian as well!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-21 00:52:03.</i></td>', '"Not bad. I personally feel that the combination of the undone buttons, the pen in the mouth and the confused, slightly neurotic look in the eyes of the model suggest something "other" than business. Or maybe another type of business, but compositionally, all the elements are there." LOL!!!! Well done Lydia. You could have title it Librarian as well!', '2009-01-21 00:50:44.000000', '2009-01-21 00:52:03.000000', 0),
