(5208597, 755084, 73981, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. Congrats on the Blue. As far as this being stock photography for business, I''m not sure it would be used for much more than snowboarding. I actually think this photo is way too interesting to be considered ''stock''. I can see this someone becoming a motivational poster, or something of the like.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. Congrats on the Blue. As far as this being stock photography for business, I''m not sure it would be used for much more than snowboarding. I actually think this photo is way too interesting to be considered ''stock''. I can see this someone becoming a motivational poster, or something of the like.', '2009-01-21 07:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
